{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SnjHT3dqPW1794608481.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：與高空擾動相關的驟雨及雷暴正逐漸遠離珠江口一帶。本港今早普遍錄得超過30毫米雨量，而東部地區及大嶼山的雨量更超過50毫米。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁，高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日大致天晴。隨後一兩日雲量較多及有一兩陣雨，但星期一風勢較大。下週中期北風增強，氣溫顯著下降。</p><p></p><p>06:00 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:29:37.040459+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:31.175851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:22:54.118321+00:00","content_hash":"8175d15e138c88ee26786c1019cf4076cd69092c86a5dfd786301d482ff3272b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:29:37.040459+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}